1 polymer     man 'Azami Red1.0' 26138.803 6    ? ? ? 
;This molecule is produced by introducing following mutations into Azami Green from Galaxea fascicularis. Mutations: P6E, C13R, R15E, I39T, L40M, N43K, A48G, T58S, T59P, V60Q, Q62M, N65S, R66K, T69I, Q76P, T82S, Y87F, S92V, Q98G, I100V, S105Q, I107T, M109L, I118V, K138G, N158I, M159K, D187G, L209Q. N-terminal residues GSH are a remnant of the His-tag. Val is inserted between M1 and S2 for protein expression. NRQ is a fluorophore formed by autocatalytic cyclization of Met62, Tyr63, and Gly64.
;
